<title>CYPRUS: Bank of Cyprus H1 pre-tax profit up 12pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Cyprus H1 pre-tax profit up 12pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(In millions of Cyprus pounds)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    17.8	vs  16.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		12.9	vs  11.5</p>
<p>    Group profit after taxes   8.9	vs   7.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank chairman Solon Triantafyllides said the profits were 'not spectacular', but satisfactory.</p>
<p>&quot;These results are considered satisfactory, taking into account the problems that the Cyprus economy is facing, particularly the reduction in tourist arrivals that has negatively affected profits from foreign exchange income,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Michele Kambas, Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
